      "id": "sol.amc-8-1995-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Zack is \\(15 + 3 = 18\\) years old.\n\nJose is \\(4\\) years younger, so Jose is \\(18 - 4 = 14\\).\n\nThus, the correct answer is C .",
